      <section class="block" id="b-a11y" data-status="yellow"><h3>Accessibility</h3><p class="note">The keyboard and screen reader are done for the main action, the other pages are not yet.</p></section>
      <section class="block" id="b-security" data-status="green"><h3>Security</h3><p class="note">The headers are set, the second factor is on, and there are no secrets in the repository.</p></section>
      <section class="block" id="b-law" data-status="red"><h3>Law</h3><p class="note">A lawyer has not yet reviewed the privacy notice, and the processor contracts are not signed.</p></section>
      <section class="block" id="b-seo" data-status="green"><h3>Search and analytics</h3><p class="note">The sitemap, the counter and the goals are set up.</p></section>
      <section class="block" id="b-action" data-status="green"><h3>The main action and content</h3><p class="note">It works on a phone, the tests are green and the links are intact.</p></section>

      <h3>What to fix</h3>
      <table id="fixes">
        <thead><tr><th>What</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead>
